import{_ as i,o as s,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 745 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Details of the Fifty Consciousness-Uplift Systems","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 745 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Details of the Fifty Consciousness-Uplift Systems","no":745,"module":4,"tags":["Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals","Consciousness Uplift","Fifty Systems","Consciousness Domain","Alaya Network"],"related":["10-300-Set Origin Cultivation System Overview","91-300-Set Cultivation System Index","21-Symbiotic-Network Operating Principle"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0745_模块4-超多元级功法-意识升维类五十套详解.md","filePath":"en/0745_模块4-超多元级功法-意识升维类五十套详解.md"}'),t={name:"en/0745_模块4-超多元级功法-意识升维类五十套详解.md"};function a(r,e,l,c,u,d){return s(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-745-hyper-multiverse-grade-manuals-details-of-the-fifty-consciousness-uplift-systems" tabindex="-1">Entry 745 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Details of the Fifty Consciousness-Uplift Systems <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-745-hyper-multiverse-grade-manuals-details-of-the-fifty-consciousness-uplift-systems" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 745 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Details of the Fifty Consciousness-Uplift Systems&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 10, 91, 21</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-consciousness-is-not-private-property-but-civilization-s-public-domain-infrastructure" tabindex="-1">Introduction: consciousness is not private property, but civilization&#39;s public-domain infrastructure <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-consciousness-is-not-private-property-but-civilization-s-public-domain-infrastructure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: consciousness is not private property, but civilization&#39;s public-domain infrastructure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the 300-set Origin Cultivation System&#39;s six categories, Consciousness Uplift is the category most easily misread by old web novels. Old web novels, once discussing &quot;consciousness,&quot; mean divine sense, mental power, inner demons — used for fighting, soul-searching, defending intrusion. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s fifty Consciousness-Uplift systems take a completely different route: consciousness is not a weapon, not private property, but <strong>civilization&#39;s public-domain infrastructure</strong>. Consciousness uplift means connecting each individual&#39;s consciousness into a larger consciousness network, letting individual consciousness expand, calibrate, and symbiose within the network.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are consciousness uplift&#39;s coordinate system: the anti-predation axiom forbids consciousness-level predation (soul-searching, body-snatching, mind control); the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the consciousness network be open equally to Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom requires individual consciousness expand rather than atrophy in the network; the causal self-discipline axiom requires cross-consciousness-domain operations be strictly reported; the law-first axiom requires consciousness laws&#39; definition be self-consistent.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-fifty-consciousness-uplift-systems-classification-framework" tabindex="-1">I. The Fifty Consciousness-Uplift Systems&#39; Classification Framework <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-fifty-consciousness-uplift-systems-classification-framework" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Fifty Consciousness-Uplift Systems&#39; Classification Framework&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The fifty Consciousness-Uplift systems, by functional direction, are divided into five subgroups of ten each:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Subgroup</th><th>Number Range</th><th>Core Direction</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Perception Expansion</td><td>101–110</td><td>Raise consciousness&#39;s perceptual precision for laws, energy, and others&#39; consciousness</td></tr><tr><td>Consciousness Purification</td><td>111–120</td><td>Clear inner demons, prejudice, predatory residue, keeping consciousness clear</td></tr><tr><td>Network Onboarding</td><td>121–130</td><td>Safely access the Alaya Network, obtaining network-wide knowledge and consensus</td></tr><tr><td>Cross-Domain Projection</td><td>131–140</td><td>Project safely in the consciousness domain for cross-plane consciousness exchange</td></tr><tr><td>Consciousness Engineering</td><td>141–150</td><td>Design and maintain civilization-level consciousness infrastructure (public knowledge base, consensus field, etc.)</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The five subgroups, from &quot;see yourself clearly&quot; to &quot;onboard the network&quot; to &quot;build the network,&quot; form a complete consciousness-uplift ladder.</p><h2 id="ii-perception-expansion-subgroup-101–110" tabindex="-1">II. Perception-Expansion Subgroup (101–110) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-perception-expansion-subgroup-101–110" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Perception-Expansion Subgroup (101–110)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>These ten systems solve the problem of &quot;consciousness perceptual precision&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>101 · Law Micro-Perception</strong>: perceive the law network&#39;s finest structural changes, reaching Alaya-Network-level precision;</li><li><strong>102 · Emotion-Field Perception</strong>: perceive the collective emotional state of all beings in a star sector, used for civilizational mental-health monitoring;</li><li><strong>103 · Causal Perception</strong>: perceive the causal chain between action and consequence, anticipating action&#39;s civilizational impact;</li><li><strong>104 · Myriad-Rank Consciousness Discrimination</strong>: distinguish consciousness traits of the five lineages (carbon/energy/mechanical/consciousness/mixed);</li><li><strong>105–110</strong>: correspond to different special-perception directions (time perception, dimension perception, law-drift perception, etc.).</li></ul><p>This subgroup&#39;s key constraint: perception is not theft. You may perceive the emotion field, but may not read others&#39; private consciousness content; you may perceive law changes, but may not use perception to locate and plunder others&#39; resources.</p><h2 id="iii-consciousness-purification-subgroup-111–120" tabindex="-1">III. Consciousness-Purification Subgroup (111–120) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-consciousness-purification-subgroup-111–120" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Consciousness-Purification Subgroup (111–120)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>These ten systems solve the problem of &quot;internal consciousness toxins&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>111 · Shortcut-Inner-Demon Clearing</strong>: systematically identify and clear all beings&#39; origin-attachment shortcut inner demons;</li><li><strong>112 · Predatory-Residue Purification</strong>: clear violent residue left in consciousness by predatory cultivation;</li><li><strong>113 · Prejudice Detachment</strong>: detach racial, gender, and class prejudice, restoring consciousness&#39;s impartiality;</li><li><strong>114 · Fear Desensitization</strong>: recover consciousness&#39;s sense of safety from reincarnation-harvest and disaster trauma;</li><li><strong>115–120</strong>: correspond to different psychological-toxin purification schemes.</li></ul><p>This subgroup is the republican axiom of Myriad Races landing at the consciousness level: an individual whose consciousness is polluted by prejudice and inner demons cannot truly co-build with Myriad Ranks; purifying consciousness is the prerequisite for him to qualify for co-building.</p><h2 id="iv-network-onboarding-subgroup-121–130" tabindex="-1">IV. Network-Onboarding Subgroup (121–130) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-network-onboarding-subgroup-121–130" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Network-Onboarding Subgroup (121–130)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>These ten systems solve the problem of &quot;how to safely access the Alaya Network&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>121 · Identity Anchoring</strong>: establish a unique, secure consciousness identity in the Alaya Network;</li><li><strong>122 · Knowledge Retrieval</strong>: safely retrieve network-wide public knowledge, not over-privately accessing private data;</li><li><strong>123 · Consensus Voting</strong>: participate in Myriad-Rank consensus decisions, one person one vote, equal weight;</li><li><strong>124 · Contribution Ledger</strong>: record individual contributions to civilization, auto-settling civilizational weight;</li><li><strong>125–130</strong>: correspond to different network-onboarding scenarios (cross-plane access, low-bandwidth access, offline cache, etc.).</li></ul><p>This subgroup is &quot;Myriad-Rank co-building&quot; realized at the consciousness level — every individual&#39;s consciousness is no longer a closed isolated island, but a node in the network.</p><h2 id="v-cross-domain-projection-and-consciousness-engineering-subgroups-131–150" tabindex="-1">V. Cross-Domain Projection and Consciousness-Engineering Subgroups (131–150) <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-cross-domain-projection-and-consciousness-engineering-subgroups-131–150" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Cross-Domain Projection and Consciousness-Engineering Subgroups (131–150)&quot;">​</a></h2><p><strong>Cross-Domain Projection (131–140)</strong>: let consciousness project safely in the consciousness domain, conducting cross-plane consciousness exchange, civilizational dialogue, and peace negotiation. Strictly constrained by the causal self-discipline axiom — only exchange knowledge, do not change the other&#39;s causality.</p><p><strong>Consciousness Engineering (141–150)</strong>: design and maintain civilization-level consciousness infrastructure:</p><ul><li>141 · Public-Knowledge-Base Architect: design the Alaya Network&#39;s knowledge classification and retrieval system;</li><li>142 · Consensus-Field Maintainer: maintain the Myriad-Rank-consensus decision field, ensuring voting is fair and transparent;</li><li>143 · Consciousness Firewall: defend against predatory-faction mental intrusion in the consciousness domain;</li><li>144–150: correspond to other civilization-level consciousness-engineering directions.</li></ul><h2 id="vi-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VI. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: if consciousness ability is only used for fighting and soul-searching, it is using civilization infrastructure as a weapon; Consciousness Uplift turns consciousness ability into a civilizational public good</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: consciousness-level predation (soul-searching, body-snatching, mind control) is explicitly forbidden; the Consciousness-Purification subgroup specifically clears predatory residue</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s consciousness ability is gift-style — whoever Gu Chensha wants to read, he reads; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s consciousness network is co-governed — every individual&#39;s data sovereignty is protected</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the fifty systems are separately adapted to the five lineages; the consciousness-information clan has an exclusive advanced path; the mechanical clan has a digital-consciousness access scheme</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the fifty systems are all open network-wide through the Selfless Dao; consciousness uplift is no longer a few chosen ones&#39; patent</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The fifty Consciousness-Uplift systems essentially transform &quot;consciousness&quot; from an individual&#39;s private domain into Myriad Ranks&#39; public square. You may freely walk, exchange, and learn on the square, but you may not take the square for yourself, nor harm others on the square. This is the basic principle of Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s consciousness engineering.</p><blockquote><p>Terminology note: the practices described in this entry ultimately land on Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm perpetual-construction posts. Every cultivator participating in engineering has his contribution recorded in real time by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, automatically settling civilizational weight. All engineering design uses the law-first axiom as meta-rule, ensuring the 300-set Origin Cultivation System coordinates at hyper-multiverse scale without self-contradiction.</p></blockquote><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/10-三百套本源修炼体系总览.html">Entry 10 · 300-Set Origin Cultivation System Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/91-三百套修炼体系索引.html">Entry 91 · 300-Set Cultivation System Index</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">Entry 21 · Symbiotic-Network Operating Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/90-术语词典.html">Entry 90 · Glossary</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const g=i(t,[["render",a]]);export{h as __pageData,g as default};
